From 85f77320f5d8de612feec2e1e0db0ecff862c037 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ttabouch12 <ttabouch12@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:17:53 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 10/21] mfd: sm5705: add Silicon Mitus SM5705 charger/flash
 block core driver

The SM5705 companion chip has a charger/flash/LED block at I2C address
0x49 with one interrupt line shared by all its functions. Add a minimal
MFD core that provides the regmap, a regmap-irq interrupt controller for
the four INT/INTMSK register pairs and a charger cell. Only the charger
is implemented so far.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C7LhHWjrzX28CzyNMEnVDk
---
